:-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"7850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1036","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,71,59,45,33,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"7850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,71,59,45,33,68],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"98","reputation":"7850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[74,71,59,45,33,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[74,71,59,45,33,68],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"98","reputation":"3250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13004","armor":"WP1006405","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀汉武将。吴匡之子，吴懿族弟，张飞部下武将，与其一同守卫阆中。张飞被害后第一时间告知刘备，随刘备的伐吴一役中担任先锋，并击败吴将孙桓，但因陆逊火烧连营而败退，被赵云所救后撤离。诸葛亮的后续北伐中以安乐侯、后将军身份参加，三出祁山时大破曹真，六次北伐时奉命与吴懿前去烧魏军浮桥，被魏将张虎、乐綝的军队射杀。","tc":"蜀漢武將。吳匡之子，吳懿族弟，張飛部下武將，與其一同守衛閬中。張飛被害后第一時間告知劉備，隨劉備的伐吳一役中擔任先鋒，并擊敗吳將孫桓，但因陸遜火燒連營而敗退，被趙云所救后撤離。諸葛亮的后續北伐中以安樂侯、后將軍身份參加，三出祁山時大破曹真，六次北伐時奉命與吳懿前去燒魏軍浮橋，被魏將張虎、樂綝的軍隊射殺。","en":"Officer of Shu-Han. Son of Wu Kuang, a younger cousin of Wu Yi, and a subordinate officer of Zhang Fei who co-garrisoned Langzhong with him. After Zhang Fei's assassination, he was the first to inform Liu Bei. During Liu Bei's campaign against Wu, he served as vanguard and defeated the Wu general Sun Huan. When Lu Xun's fire attack destroyed the connected camps, he was forced to retreat and was rescued by Zhao Yun. In Zhuge Liang's later Northern Expeditions, he participated as Marquis of Anle and Rear Commander. During the third expedition to Qishan he helped rout Cao Zhen, and during the sixth he was ordered alongside Wu Yi to burn the Wei army's pontoon bridge, but was shot and killed by the forces of the Wei generals Zhang Hu and Yue Chen.","jp":"蜀漢の武将。呉匡の子で、呉懿の族弟。張飛配下の武将として共に閬中を守った。張飛が殺害されるといち早く劉備に報告し、劉備の呉討伐戦では先鋒を務めて呉将の孫桓を撃破した。しかし陸遜の火計によって連営を焼かれて敗退し、趙雲に救われて撤退した。諸葛亮のその後の北伐には安楽侯・後将軍として従軍し、三度祁山に出陣した際には曹真を大破した。第六次北伐の際には呉懿と共に魏軍の浮橋を焼くよう命を受け出撃するも、魏将の張虎と楽綝の軍勢によって射殺された。","kr":"촉한의 무장. 오광의 아들이자 오의의 족제(친척 아우)로, 장비 휘하의 무장으로서 함께 낭중을 지켰다. 장비가 살해당하자 즉각 유비에게 이를 알렸고, 유비의 오나라 정벌에서 선봉을 맡아 오나라 장수 손환을 격파했으나 육손의 화공으로 연영이 불타며 패퇴했다가 조운에게 구출되어 퇴각했다. 제갈량의 후속 북벌에도 안락후, 후장군의 신분으로 참전하여 3차 기산 출진 때 조진을 대파했고, 6차 북벌 때 오의와 함께 위군의 부교를 불태우라는 명을 받고 나섰다가 위나라 장수 장호와 악침의 군사들에게 사살당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10371","remark":"","surname":"吴","surnameTc":"吳","surnameEn":"Wu","surnameJp":"呉","surnameKr":"오","surnameOther":"","name":"班","nameTc":"班","nameEn":"Ban","nameJp":"班","nameKr":"반","nameOther":"","word":"元雄","wordTc":"元雄","wordEn":"Yuanxiong","wordJp":"元雄","wordKr":"원웅","wordOther":"","icon":"吴班","power":"WJ10045","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1040","gender":"0","rule":"74","force":"71","wise":"59","politics":"45","charm":"33","will":"68","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"8","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"2","wi